Herdr Codex Images

Independent native integration patches for Herdr app and OpenAI Codex.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the upstream projects.

Herdr app source: https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app
OpenAI Codex source: https://github.com/openai/codex

Upstream license copies and the Codex NOTICE are preserved in licenses/.
The preview runtime releases redistribute patched Herdr app and Codex binaries,
the official Herdr core, and Codex platform companions/resources. Their licenses
and notices are included in the release. Herdr core source:
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-core

Windows packages also retain the official ConPTY license/notices and include
unmodified Microsoft VC++ runtime DLLs with their copyright and license references.
